iec61850-interop dscsystems adapter
===================================

This directory (adapters/dscsystems/) and the image built from it,
ghcr.io/otfabric/iec61850-interop-dscsystems, contain and link
dscsystems/go-iec61850 (https://github.com/dscsystems/go-iec61850),
which is licensed under the GNU General Public License version 3.

Because the adapter programs link that library, the source code in this
directory is distributed under the GNU General Public License version 3
as well (see LICENSE), unlike the rest of iec61850-interop, which is MIT.

Pinned upstream: github.com/dscsystems/go-iec61850 v0.6.6, commit
4833767caf3abbf1f205c4c49cd9432744beaf83, as recorded in go.mod and
go.sum. Corresponding source: that commit of the upstream
repository, and this directory at the iec61850-interop tag the image was
built from.

Licensing boundary: no code from dscsystems/go-iec61850, and no code from
this directory, may be copied or vendored into the MIT-licensed
otfabric/go-mms or otfabric/go-iec61850 libraries. They talk to this
adapter only over the network (MMS over TCP, GOOSE and Sampled Values
over Ethernet) and its JSON Lines output, as separate programs.
